607
00:34:10,543 --> 00:34:11,855
Mmm-Mmm.

608
00:34:11,952 --> 00:34:12,847
Sí.

609
00:34:13,968 --> 00:34:14,832
Guau.

610
00:34:17,104 --> 00:34:18,768
Jala, yo... yo no he tenido a nadie

611
