641
00:35:31,183 --> 00:35:32,720
Muy bien, buena suerte.

642
00:35:45,072 --> 00:35:46,256
Señor Fox.

643
00:35:48,912 --> 00:35:49,776
Mi héroe.

644
00:35:50,928 --> 00:35:52,112
